---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Resources
description: Practical guides on artificial turf in South Africa — pricing, preparation, drainage and care.
eyebrow: Resources
heading: Guides & resources.
lede: Plain-language answers for homeowners, estates and property managers.
breadcrumbs:
  - label: Resources
---
<section class="section section--flush-top">
  <div class="wrap">
    <ul class="post-list">
      {% for post in collections.resources %}
      <li data-reveal><a class="post-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
        <time class="mono" datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <h2 class="post-card__title">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        <span class="svc-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a></li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
